=== MA10 cheat vs honest ===
cheat_same_bar_sharpe 5.2663 nav 2.290582
honest_shift1_sharpe -1.1193 nav 0.818344
lookahead_def: using today's close in the signal while earning today's close-to-close return.

=== recap: survivorship & data snooping (see data-cleaning) ===
survivorship: today's members != historical universe — replaying only survivors inflates means.
snooping: choosing rules after peeking at full-sample ranks / many unlabeled trials.
cross_link: /phase/data-honest-backtests/data-cleaning

