best_train_w 35 sharpe_train 0.1796 sharpe_test -1.9121
mean_train_sharpe -0.3244 mean_test_sharpe -1.8102
teach: picking max in-sample Sharpe after many trials overstates OOS — log trial counts.

=== freeze-then-holdout ===
develop_n 220 holdout_n 80
frozen_w 35
sharpe_develop 0.1717
sharpe_holdout -2.1282
quant_arena_spirit: research feedback only on an earlier window; freeze one rule; score a sealed later window (arXiv:2610.30113).

