contrast: single hold-out gives ONE OOS SR=-1.3379; CPCV-style combos give a DISTRIBUTION of 15 test SRs (mean=-0.8222, std=1.4427)
teach: combinatorial test blocks reuse information across paths — paths are NOT independent trials; use the SR distribution to stress-test stability, not to mint N free trials for DSR.
